meniwala ya i abraham at mibendisyunan ya inya mibendisyunan la namang kalupa na ding sablang maniwala
migsakab ya lele nang bitis at ngana kanaku yu na pu ipagpa ing mua yu oneng ipakisabi kung mayap king pakiramdaman yu pa mu ing sabian ku
oneng misan a bengi tiki de ring kayabe nang saulo at pepatagusgus de kilub ning buslu king metung a busbus ning pader i saulo karin jerusalem
