aturu me ing dalanan da ring batuin king miyayaliwang panaun at ing dalanan da ring batuin ning maragul at ning malating saru king banua
menupa ya namang dinalan a libung sundalus a ibat king israel king alagang apat a toneladang pilak
lawan mu milalu la karakal ding kakung kalaban pawa ra kung kasaman at buring panasakitan
e ka maglambat keng obra mung yan at antimu rin ding taung deti masiadung dakal yan para king kataung anti ika
