abalu ku munaman king mika aring mayupaya a sinakup keting siudad at migari king mabilug a probinsia dane albugan ning ilug ning eufrates at memayad lang miyayaliwang buis ding memalen karela
depat na iti ban miyarap ya king sarili na ing iglesia a mitmung leguan alang dungis o kulumpis nanuman banal at alang kapintasan
